  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"358\" data-start=\"330\"><strong data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"334\">Brand Introduction</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"359\"><strong data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"359\">Natural Spinel Gem</strong> specialises in one-of-a-kind, high-end spinels for discerning collectors, fine jewellery designers, and those seeking truly unique engagement rings. Each gem is hand-selected for its rarity &mdash; <strong data-end=\"598\" data-start=\"574\">completely untreated</strong> and <strong data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"603\">naturally formed over millions of years</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"649\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"654\"><strong data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"658\">Product Description</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"684\">Our loose spinel gemstones are curated for clients who appreciate nature&rsquo;s most authentic creations. Unlike mass-produced or synthetic alternatives, every stone in our collection showcases its <strong data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"877\">genuine geological heritage</strong> &mdash; with exceptional colour, natural clarity, and precision cutting.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"979\">Whether you choose to collaborate with your trusted jeweller for a bespoke design, or preserve the gem as a collector&rsquo;s treasure, these spinels are made to inspire.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"1145\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1180\" data-start=\"1150\"><strong data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1154\">What Makes Us Unique</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1182\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1182\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1184\"><strong data-end=\"1199\" data-start=\"1184\">Exclusivity</strong> &ndash; Each stone is nature&rsquo;s own signature, completely one-of-a-kind</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1336\" data-start=\"1267\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1336\" data-start=\"1269\"><strong data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1269\">Rarity</strong> &ndash; 100% natural, with <strong data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1301\">no treatments or enhancements</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1337\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1339\"><strong data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1339\">Provenance</strong> &ndash; Sourced directly from <strong data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1378\">Mogok, Myanmar</strong>, home to the world&rsquo;s finest coloured gemstones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1450\" data-start=\"1447\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1490\" data-start=\"1452\"><strong data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1456\">Authenticity &amp; Certification</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1707\" data-start=\"1491\">We specialise exclusively in <strong data-end=\"1575\" data-start=\"1520\">natural, untreated gemstones of the highest quality</strong>. Certification can be arranged upon request through any <strong data-end=\"1673\" data-start=\"1632\">UK-accredited gemmological laboratory</strong>, with costs covered by the buyer.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1944\" data-start=\"1709\">If you&rsquo;re looking for lower-cost alternatives, man-made or mass-produced gemstones are widely available elsewhere. Our collection is reserved for <strong data-end=\"1943\" data-start=\"1855\">discerning clients who value the rare, irreplaceable beauty of nature&rsquo;s own artistry</strong>.</p>",
